on-arrival: {! if (typeof Q.syncActionEconomyDisplay === 'function') { Q.syncActionEconomyDisplay() } !}

= Carbon Drawing Guild


In a station as old as Mikasa there are numerous corners of the city that still use obsolete air filtration tech.  Generations of carbon drawing workers have learned the skills of kludging together repairs for systems anywhere from a century to a week old.  Their base of operations is a magpie's nest of ancient machinery where a small crowd sits around playing cards while "on call" for any hypothetical emergencies.

- @mutual_aid
- @public_aid
- @sector_integration
- @gotv
- @return

@mutual_aid
title: Mutual Aid networks
subtitle: Equipment pooling, reciprocal lending
choose-if: worker_actions_remaining > 0 or month_actions_remaining > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [! if worker_actions_remaining > 0: No worker actions left ?][! if month_actions_remaining > 0: No generic actions left ?]No organizing actions left this month.
on-arrival: {!
Q.spendWorkerActionWithFallback();
Q.bumpBlockProsperity('Aurora', 'first', 0.05);
if (typeof Q.syncProsperityDisplays === 'function') { Q.syncProsperityDisplays() }
!}

The group helps folks within the first wave stretch their resources until the next paycheck.

@public_aid
title: Public aid network
subtitle: Help within the area, requires group prosperity
choose-if: worker_actions_remaining > 0 or month_actions_remaining > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [! if worker_actions_remaining > 0: No worker actions left ?][! if month_actions_remaining > 0: No generic actions left ?]No organizing actions left this month.
on-arrival: {!
Q.spendWorkerActionWithFallback();
// Requires: Q.prosperity_first > average district prosperity
Q.bumpBlockProsperity('Aurora', 'first', 0.03);
Q.bumpBlockProsperity('Aurora', 'drone', 0.02);
if (typeof Q.syncProsperityDisplays === 'function') { Q.syncProsperityDisplays() }
!}

Group leverages its relative advantage to help others in the district.

@sector_integration
title: Sector integration
subtitle: ONE-TIME TRIGGER - Power up the group
choose-if: worker_actions_remaining > 0 or month_actions_remaining > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [! if worker_actions_remaining > 0: No worker actions left ?][! if month_actions_remaining > 0: No generic actions left ?]No organizing actions left this month.
on-arrival: carbon_drawing_guild_sector_triggered = 1; {!
Q.spendWorkerActionWithFallback();
// TODO: Implement one-time trigger for citywide sector improvement
// Citywide effect: e.g., a station-wide air filtration overhaul
if (typeof Q.syncProsperityDisplays === 'function') { Q.syncProsperityDisplays() }
!}

Once organized, the group can trigger a permanent citywide improvement in their sector.

@gotv
title: Get out the vote
subtitle: Canvas for SDF support
choose-if: worker_actions_remaining > 0 or month_actions_remaining > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [! if worker_actions_remaining > 0: No worker actions left ?][! if month_actions_remaining > 0: No generic actions left ?]No organizing actions left this month.
on-arrival: {!
Q.spendWorkerActionWithFallback();
Q.workers_canvas_Aurora = (Number(Q.workers_canvas_Aurora) || 0) + 1;
if (typeof Q.update_projections === 'function') { Q.update_projections() }
!}

Word of mouth canvassing to convince workers that supporting the SDF could actually make a difference.
